# Derived by hand from ruling PL: `@Gen` at position 1 starts a list; its `rebuild` at 0 extends it with the generation and the row's places (`1/0.#0.0`, `1/0.#0.1`); the click on the old generation's button changes nothing; the next generation is `#1`.
test a_generation_extends_its_widgets_list

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1/0.#0.0: Ui.Button(label="hit 0")
    1/0.#0.1: Ui.Label(text="gen 0")

tick 1
  in:
    1/0.#0.0: click

tick 2
  in:
    0: click
  added:
    1/0.#1.0: Ui.Button(label="hit 1")
    1/0.#1.1: Ui.Label(text="gen 1")
  torn down:
    1/0.#0.0: Ui.Button(label="hit 0")
    1/0.#0.1: Ui.Label(text="gen 0")
